Arriving at my apartment building, I climb the stairs.
Taking the key from the bag, I open the door.
Stepping inside, I close the door.
I take off my shoes near the door.
The flat is very quiet.
It is very hot outside now.
Therefore, I turn on the light and fan.
I put the laptop bag and vegetables on the table.
I walk to the kitchen.
I take a glass of water and drink it.
After that, I sit on the sofa.
Today's work is finished.
I am very tired now.
